      "position": [
        960,
        -300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Part 3 of 3: Log the lead and alert sales\n**AI Lead Intelligence and Qualification**\n\n1. Log Lead: saves every lead into a Data Table. The `leads` Data Table is created for you automatically when n8n starts, so there is nothing to upload.\n2. Is Hot Lead?: checks the score. A high fit score or high urgency marks the lead as hot.\n3. Connect your messenger application to notify sales team: a placeholder. The original build sent a Slack alert here for hot leads, but Slack needs its own login, which will not be possible for everyone live, so it has been left as a do nothing node. Swap in Slack, WhatsApp, Microsoft Teams, or whatever messaging app your team already uses.\n\nImport this after part 2 and connect Score Lead with AI into Log Lead.",
        "width": 820,
        "height": 300
      }
    }
